      <div type="clause" n="28">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 28</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif weofodþen be boca tæcincge his agen lif rihtlice fadige, þonne sy he fulles þegnweres ⁊ weorðscipes wurðe, ge on life ge on legere.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a member of the priesthood orders his own life aright, according to the teaching of the canon law, he shall be entitled to the full wergeld and privileges of a thegn, both during his life and after his death.</ab>
      </div>
